  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvelocity-blur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fYYF7bR1/Gemini-Generated-Image-9l10bk9l10bk9l10-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"243\" height=\"137\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Velocity Blur</strong> 是一款小型的客户端模组，会根据你的移动速度添加速度模糊效果。你移动得越快，模糊效果就越强。它还在右上角显示一个简单的速度计数器（每秒方块数，可选）。</p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7t2rgX4W/11-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"481\" height=\"271\"><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><br><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Oe4eZmJHCoI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>功能：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>随玩家速度变化的运动模糊</li>\n<li>简单的速度 HUD：<code>xx.xx blocks/s</code>（右上角）（可选）</li>\n<li>仅限客户端</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>配置：<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xtsn1gCK/123.png\"></p>",
